      "rendered": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"76\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/rough-rock-002/rough_rock_002_render/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png?fit=840%2C494&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"840,494\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Rough_rock_002_RENDER\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png?fit=800%2C470&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-76\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png?resize=800%2C470&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Rough_rock_002_RENDER\" width=\"800\" height=\"470\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"76\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/04/22/rough-rock-002/rough_rock_002_render/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png?fit=840%2C494&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"840,494\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Rough_rock_002_RENDER\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png?fit=800%2C470&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-76 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20840%20494%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Rough_rock_002_RENDER\" width=\"840\" height=\"494\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/rough_rock_002_render.png\"></p>\n<p>Rough Rock 002</p>\n<p>Seamless texture, 1024 x 1024, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Specularity</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Ys8Cd_1RaFjUMyWehhaLqBoWVQQEPw_7?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></strong></p>\n<p>As always it&#8217;s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don&#8217;t be a prick a tell it&#8217;s yours.</p>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I&#8217;ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all me textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I&#8217;ll be posting more soon.</p>\n",
